{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑ウブゲちゃんとか気にしないでー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゃはははっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて表現したらいいか、\n沢山の暖かいコメント大切に大事に感謝しながら読ませてもらいました。\nありがとうございましたーー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々なアドバイス、元気、パワー、\nとっても素晴らしいものを皆様からいただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の言葉って強くて温かくて、パワーが湧いてくるんだな〜って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーなんなんだよーみんなぁぁぁーーーー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心の充電完了したので、皆様に元気と笑顔を届けたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間はものすごい勢いで過ぎていってるんだ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日は24時間ですもんね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切に使わなきゃ!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばる!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はは最後の公演です\n自分でもどこまで出来るかわかりませんが、私も、皆様にも楽しんでもらえるように最後まで全力で頑張ります!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様の思いがまあやの心に響いたように、会場のfamilyと、これない方にまでどうかまあやパワーが届きますように〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユッキーナ、\n寧々ちゃん\nひなちま\nゆみ姉\nステージには居ないけど気持ちは乃木坂46...33名です!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぞー!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\n前回の記事でも書きましたが、\nひよこの件です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私とひよこが似てる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってる方！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おおすぎますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うぇーんっ！涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにもーーーっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニワトリになってやる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニワトリになると川後様が行ってた気がする........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして友達にあだ名がニワトリ！\nって人がいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コケコッコー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁー友達がまあやのblog見てませんように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの！ポテト！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらずのかわいさでしょー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと大きくなったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そういえば、この前の劇場の公演の前、学校だったんだけど、友達が、\n『blog見てるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれて........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぁーーーっっっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し照れたけど..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも嬉かった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントで、声に出して声援を送りたいけど出来ない...とか、握手会で思ってた事を話せなかった...って方が居て、それってわかる!!って思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも気持ちをうまく伝える事が出来ない事があります..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもブログだと書けたり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声援は声に出してもらえたら本当に嬉しいけど、思ってもらえてるとコメントで伝えてくださった事も、とても嬉しいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちを素直に伝えるって難しいって思ったりします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちが強くなればなるほど、後でちゃんと伝えれば良かった...って思ったりします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも素直に伝えれるようになりたいから、一緒に頑張ってもらいたいなぁ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたまた話しは変わって、メンバーの事〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイとナーチャンのやりとりで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川\n『だれか色鉛筆もってないー？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西野\n『私６０色の色鉛筆もってるよ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、この話を聞いアメイジングだと思いました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さずか西野さん！ちなみに60色の色鉛筆３つも持ってるらしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貴方はもぅ、\n『アメイジング西野さん』\nだよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで読んでくださった方Thank You"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おりゅりょりょりょーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、読み逃げ禁止だじょ笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のタイトルはコメントにあった言葉を使わせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は皆はなにするのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/09/4612425/0007.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}